OL,3,AIran-backed Houthis reportedly reach
OL,4,Astrategic island in key global shipping
OL,5,Aroute
OL,6,
OL,7,FFighters from the Iran-backed Houthi
OL,8,Fmovement have captured a key island on
OL,9,Fthe Red Sea, a government source says
OL,11,FPerim Island divides the Bab al-Mandab
OL,12,FStrait, the southern gateway to a trade
OL,13,Froute that links Asia and Europe -
OL,14,Fhere's why it is significant
OL,16,FThe Houthis have said they pose no
OL,17,Fthreat to international shipping but
OL,18,Fhave reiterated their threat to target
OL,19,Fvessels from Saudi Arabia
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
